830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com", "ExternalName": "Triin Lepp", "PrincipalType": "user", "id": "triin@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com"}, "createdDateTime": "2026-10-26T08:15:00Z", "modifiedDateTime": "2026-10-26T08:15:00Z", "commentText": "I have started working on the fix.", "entityContent": "SSBoYXZlIHN0YXJ0ZWQgd29ya2luZyBvbiB0aGUgZml4Lg==", "entityEncoding": "b64", "entityFormat": "txt", "CommentId": 1014201}, {"entitySemanticType": "comment", "parentCommentId": null, "mentionedUsers": [], "commentId": "1ea0fde8-8f93-5f45-97d5-f74ba3a0e8a5", "creator": {"ExternalId": "9f2737ce-5372-552e-9c59-28b7e7362d7e", "Email": "triin@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com", "ExternalName": "Triin Lepp", "PrincipalType": "user", "id": "triin@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com"}, "modifier": {"ExternalId": "9f2737ce-5372-552e-9c59-28b7e7362d7e", "Email": "triin@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com", "ExternalName": "Triin Lepp", "PrincipalType": "user", "id": "triin@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com"}, "createdDateTime": "2026-10-29T08:25:00Z", "modifiedDateTime": "2026-10-29T08:25:00Z", "commentText": "Legacy-path fix is in review. Platform review asked for the same correction on the event-driven status service, because the pilot stores move to it at the November 20 cutover. That work depends on the reconnect-state design decision, which is still waiting for platform sign-off. Flagging this as at risk. I can't give a date until the design is approved.", "entityContent": "", "entityEncoding": "b64", "entityFormat": "txt", "CommentId": 1014202}, {"entitySemanticType": "comment", "parentCommentId": null, "mentionedUsers": [], "commentId": "17ff59d0-1d0f-581e-b144-5ccd56103219", "creator": {"ExternalId": "5e1bc012-0344-5365-b6c6-24a62ec488ee", "Email": "kerry@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com", "ExternalName": "Kerry Allen", "PrincipalType": "user", "id": "kerry@a830edad9050849coepf8OCnm71.onmicrosoft.com"}, "modifie